---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Contact — YuzuBack" description="Contact the YuzuBack project." active="contact">
  <section class="wrap page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">Get in touch</span><h1>Contact YuzuBack.</h1><p>Questions, feedback, and bug reports help make the app better. This page is ready for the project's preferred support channels.</p></section>
  <section class="wrap content contact-layout"><article class="content-card"><span class="kicker">Support</span><h2>How can we help?</h2><div class="contact-row"><b>Bug report</b><span>Include your YuzuBack version, operating system, and steps to reproduce the issue.</span></div><div class="contact-row"><b>Feature idea</b><span>Describe the task you want YuzuBack to make easier and how you handle it today.</span></div><div class="contact-row"><b>General question</b><span>For setup and restore questions, include the relevant profile and restic details, without sharing passwords or repository keys.</span></div></article><aside class="content-card"><span class="kicker">Contact channel</span><h2>Support address pending</h2><p>The official contact email or issue tracker has not been supplied yet.</p><div class="notice">Add the project's support email or public issue tracker here before sharing this page with visitors.</div><p class="legal">YuzuBack is the new name for Easy Backup Manager (EBM).</p></aside></section>
</SiteLayout>
